  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe `site` job of `release.yml` run 45269109413 (tag v0.26.0) failed at \"Site tests\", so the 0.26.0 site was not deployed. `main` failed the same 6 tests. This PR makes the guide agree with the shipped app again:\n\n- `site/static/icons/`: add `op-waterjet-profile.png` and `op-multiaxis-deburr.png`, byte copies of `assets/ui/`.\n- New page `site/content/guide/operations/operations-waterjet.md`: the Waterjet Profile operation, its settings, defaults and refusals.\n- `operations-multiaxis.md`: a Multi-Axis Deburr section.\n- `site/static/operation-paths.svg`: the two toolpath pictures.\n- `post-processors.md`: the `onJetOn` / `onJetOff` hooks, the `uprightReturn`, `lineEnding` and `linearizeArcs` manifest rows, and `waterjet` in `serves`.\n- `machines.md`: remove the stale sentence \"No waterjet operation kind and no post for it ship yet\".\n- `site/tests/test_operation_reference.py`: add the two kinds to `FAMILIES` (the test says \"Update the reference when OpType changes\"). No check is weakened.\n- Decision: `docs/decisions/3763-site-tests.md` (the waterjet page stays outside the catalog page list, so the same fix applies to `site/v0.26.0` with no `xtask` change).\n\n## How tested\n\n- `python -m unittest discover -s site/tests` with zola 0.23.6 and `PYTHONUTF8=1`: 94 tests, OK. Before the fix: 6 failures (the same as the release run).\n- Pinned by `test_guide_icons.GuideIcons.test_component_static_icons_and_license_match_app`, `test_operation_reference.OperationReferencePictures.test_every_operation_has_section_and_picture`, `test_post_processor_reference.PostProcessorReference.test_engine_hooks_have_reference_entries`, `test_post_processor_reference.PostProcessorReference.test_manifest_properties_have_reference_rows`.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- `cargo xtask catalog --check` was not run to the end (it builds the app). The new Multi-Axis Deburr block has the exact generated form, and no catalog case names the two kinds.\n- No Rust code changed, so there is no cargo gate.\n\nFollow-up: #3764 (run the site tests before a cut).\n\nChangelog: none (docs only)\nEffort: high (issue effort:medium)\n\nFixes #3763\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
